{"ref":"BDB, לֶ֫מֶך","hw":"לֶ֫מֶך","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">לֶ֫מֶך</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.m. (</strong>on orig. form cf. Lag<sup>BN 77</sup>; conj. as to meaning Bu<sup>Urgesch. 102, 129</sup><strong>)</strong>;—<span dir=\"rtl\">ל׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 4:19\" href=\"/Genesis.4.19\">Gn 4:19</a> + 7 times; <span dir=\"rtl\">לָ֑מֶךְ</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 4:18\" href=\"/Genesis.4.18\">4:18</a> + 2 times;—<br><strong>1.</strong>  son of <span dir=\"rtl\">מְתוּשָׁאֵל</span> (Cainite) <a data-ref=\"Genesis 4:18\" href=\"/Genesis.4.18\">Gn 4:18</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 4:19\" href=\"/Genesis.4.19\">19</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 4:23\" href=\"/Genesis.4.23\">23</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 4:24\" href=\"/Genesis.4.24\">24</a> (all J).<br><strong>2.</strong>  son of <span dir=\"rtl\">מְתוּשֶׁלַח</span> (Sethite) <a data-ref=\"Genesis 5:25\" href=\"/Genesis.5.25\">Gn 5:25</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 5:26\" href=\"/Genesis.5.26\">26</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 5:28\" href=\"/Genesis.5.28\">28</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 5:30\" href=\"/Genesis.5.30\">30</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 5:31\" href=\"/Genesis.5.31\">31</a> (all P), <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 1:3\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.1.3\">1 Ch 1:3</a>.—𝔊 Λαμεχ.","next":"BDB, לְמִן","prev":"BDB, לְמוֹא֯ל"}